issue_context.body:
When a geo_point field is defined as a runtime field, and there are values for it in indexed documents, the exists query returns 0 results when made against such field. When the same field is defined as an indexed field, the same query returns results.

```
curl -XPUT -HContent-Type:application/json -u elastic:password 'localhost:9200/test?pretty' -d'{
  "mappings" : {
    "runtime" : {
        "location" : {
          "type" : "geo_point"
        }
    }
  }
}
'

curl -XPOST -HContent-Type:application/json -u elastic:password 'localhost:9200/test/_doc/1?pretty&refresh=wait_for' -d'{
  "location": [-71.34, 41.14]
}
'

curl -X POST "localhost:9200/test/_search?pretty" -u elastic-admin:elastic-password -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d'
{
  "query" : {
    "exists" : {
      "field" : "location"
    }
  }
}
'
```
